### Data & Document Ownership Notice

All medical admission records, seat allotment results, state rank merit lists, seat matrix PDFs, and counselling notification documents indexed or hosted in this repository are public domain government publications downloaded directly from the official web portals of the Medical Counselling Committee (MCC), the Directorate General of Health Services (DGHS), Government of India, and respective State/UT admissions directorates and universities.

The MIT License applies exclusively to the software source code, parsing pipelines, scripts, and website architecture created for Canonify. Intellectual property and copyright in the underlying admissions notices remain with their respective issuing statutory authorities.
